{"name":"Sarshel","status":"ok","title":"Sarshel","pageId":37807,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Sarshel\" title=\"Category:Maps of Sarshel\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sarshel</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alt spelling\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alt. spelling</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sarshal</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1359_DR\" title=\"1359 DR\">1359 DR</a><br/>18,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1347_DR\" title=\"1347 DR\">1347 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Sarshel\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Sarshel\">Inhabitants of  Sarshel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Sarshel\" title=\"Category:Locations in Sarshel\">Locations in  Sarshel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9TYXJzaGVsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Sarshel (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Sarshel</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Sarshel</b> was a walled port city of <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> As of the late 15<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, it was better known as <a href=\"/wiki/New_Sarshel\" title=\"New Sarshel\">New Sarshel</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Marhymbel_House_Shipways\" title=\"Marhymbel House Shipways\">Marhymbel House Shipways</a>, one of the fastest ship-builders in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a>, led by brothers <a href=\"/wiki/Ilund_Marhymbel\" title=\"Ilund Marhymbel\">Ilund</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vromur_Marhymbel\" title=\"Vromur Marhymbel\">Vromur Marhymbel</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1490_DR\" title=\"1490 DR\">1490s</a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tev-ships_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tev-ships-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?action=edit\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">expanding it</a>.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/R.A._Salvatore\" title=\"R.A. Salvatore\">R.A. Salvatore</a> (1989). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodstone_Lands_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Bloodstone Lands (sourcebook)\">The Bloodstone Lands</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Elizabeth_T._Danforth\" title=\"Elizabeth T. Danforth\">Elizabeth T. Danforth</a>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 29. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-771-8\">0-88038-771-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p88-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p88_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a> (August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/